  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Soil Fertility Mapping Program (RSFMP) of West Africa - Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of this project is to improve smallholder agricultural productivity through better
management of their soils. The specific objectives are to develop balanced fertilizer products
and integrated soil fertility management recommendations targeted to specific crops needs,
according to specific soil and agro-climatic conditions that will substantially and sustainably
increase yields and nutritional quality and result in increased returns on fertilizer investments.</narrative>
  </description>
